==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|възводити}}. {{surf|ru|воз-|води́ть}}. {{doublet|ru|взводи́ть}}, the inherited East Slavic form.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|возводи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-возводить.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-возводить.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|возводи́ть|impf|pf=возвести́}}

# to [[raise]], to [[erect]]
# {{lb|ru|math}} to [[exponentiate]], to [[raise]] to a [[power]]
# to [[derive]] {{+obj|ru|:к(dat)<from something in the past>}}
# to [[cast]] (an accusation)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''возводи́ть''' [[обвине́ние]] [[на]] [[кто-либо|кого́-либо]] [[в]] [[что-либо|че́м-либо]]|to [[accuse]] someone of something}}

